; ============================================================================
;  recruit_action.sqs  -  thin addAction dispatcher for the recruit system.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  This is the script FILE addAction runs when the player pulls a Camp menu
;  entry. In this engine addAction's 2nd element is a script file name, opened
;  and run with _this bound to [target, caller, actionId]
;  (EntityAI::AddUserAction -> Script(desc->script,[this,person,id]),
;   VehicleAIPilot.cpp:1064-1072).
;
;  It deliberately does NO state mutation: it only ENQUEUES the request so that
;  recruit.sqs's loop remains the single writer of GM_PLAYER_GROUPS and the
;  gmResources/gmManpower debits. recruit.sqs polls gmReqPending every second
;  and dispatches on gmReqId (matched against gmActRecruit/gmActSpec/gmActTrain).
;
;  Confirmed cmds only: select (array), assignment. No `~` (runs unscheduled).
; ============================================================================

gmReqId = _this select 2
gmReqCaller = _this select 1
gmReqPending = true
exit
